<BaseLayout
  title="Shipping from China to Germany: Hamburg Routing, 30–38-Day Sea &amp; 18–22-Day Rail Transit, EU Duty &amp; 19% VAT (September 2026)"
  description="China to Germany freight guide: Shanghai, Ningbo-Zhoushan and Shenzhen to Hamburg (DEHAM), roughly 30–38-day sea transit via the Cape, 18–22-day rail transit, FCL vs LCL decision, EU common duty, 19% VAT, EORI and hidden destination charges."
  canonical={pageUrl}
  ogType="article"
  schema={schema}
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumb
